{"id": "vd1", "act": "verdict", "body": "Fictional person G: the audit's verdict is 2, real disagreement, as g3 proposed. The insured and the district court agree on what was done and differ on which reading the endorsement carries; nothing in the policy defines the word. An ambiguity in an insurance contract is read for the insured, and the Court did so (l1). The application is a separate clause of the contract, not a reading of \"landscaping\", so a reading that takes it in (g2:P4) answers another question. I adopt g3:vd1.", "author": "G (fictional counsel for the insured)", "kind": "person", "value": "2", "object": "g3 (for A):q1", "absent": null, "sources": [], "rests": ["g3 (for A):vd1", "G (fictional counsel for the insured):l1", "G (fictional counsel for the insured):h1", "G (fictional counsel for the insured):h2"], "answers": [], "about": null, "narrows": null, "withdraws": null, "reason": null, "procedure": null, "via": null, "log": "G (fictional counsel for the insured)", "prev": "e4ef8078d3fbf6c268559563654675e05f3ff1e9ff4cd532b6f7476e09c4ab84", "rest_hashes": ["494286f963f5d65835272209d8831f0088e831ca2a83ca25afc72fb1eecbd162", "df3ab3f95717abf09c87f700489a2697ec2a6ded56869bc11ee93bcfa74970da", "d8f0dc67a4fa255c7b0b1488688bcd31ce81f57ced9bfb7add6f1277092d0012", "e4ef8078d3fbf6c268559563654675e05f3ff1e9ff4cd532b6f7476e09c4ab84"], "hash": "0acc59076cd0e7616926fd838e0be160eef5876a5305dd6a615dc8d688593397", "sig": "2b64c52b5e2b3e478e74cc385507a7f6b7db2a589f6d5db1701a1308206912fe3cdac2f458bd69ac81a3669bef3bbc1879c355537b532fc2a65c1a1063bfa00d"}
